---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';
import TalkBanner from '../components/TalkBanner.astro';
import LegalDoc from '../components/LegalDoc.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
import { withBase } from '../config/paths';

// The website's terms of use (draft, 2026-10-27). Client work is covered by /terms/.
---

<BaseLayout page="user-agreement">
  <SiteHeader slot="header" />

  <LegalDoc
    title="User agreement"
    updated="27 October 2026"
    note="This agreement is new and is awaiting review."
  >
    <h2>1. About this agreement</h2>
    <p>
      This agreement covers using this website, its forms and its enquiry endpoint. By using the
      site, you accept it. If you hire us, our{' '}
      <a href={withBase('/terms/')}>terms and conditions</a> cover that work.
    </p>

    <h2>2. Using the site</h2>
    <p>The site is free to use. Please don't:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>try to break into, overload or disrupt the site or the systems behind it;</li>
      <li>upload or send anything harmful, such as viruses or malicious code;</li>
      <li>use the site for anything unlawful, misleading or harmful to anyone else.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. Search engines, AI assistants and crawlers</h2>
    <p>
      Search engines, AI assistants and other crawlers are welcome to read, index, summarise and
      quote this site, including <a href={withBase('/llms.txt')}>llms.txt</a> and the Markdown
      copies of each page, as set out in our <a href={withBase('/robots.txt')}>robots.txt</a>. When
      you quote us, please link back to the page. Please crawl at a reasonable pace.
    </p>

    <h2>4. The forms and the enquiry endpoint</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        Send genuine enquiries only. An AI agent may send one on behalf of a person who asked it to.
      </li>
      <li>
        Don't send spam or bulk messages, and don't enter someone else's details without their
        permission.
      </li>
      <li>We may block anyone who misuses the forms or the endpoint.</li>
      <li>
        Sending an enquiry doesn't create a contract. A contract starts only when you accept a
        written quote from us.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>5. Our content</h2>
    <p>
      The text, design, logo, images and code of this site belong to {site.fullName} or the people
      who licensed them to us. You may view the site, share links to it and quote short passages
      with a link back. Please don't copy the design or the brand, or present our content as your
      own. Names and trademarks of other businesses belong to their owners.
    </p>

    <h2>6. Accuracy</h2>
    <p>
      We keep the site accurate and up to date, but prices and services can change. The price and
      scope in your written quote are the ones that apply. Examples on the site, such as sample
      results, are labelled as examples.
    </p>

    <h2>7. Links to other sites</h2>
    <p>
      We link to other websites, such as WhatsApp, Instagram and our clients' sites. We don't
      control them and are not responsible for their content or how they handle your information.
    </p>

    <h2>8. Availability and responsibility</h2>
    <p>
      We work to keep the site running and secure, but we can't promise it will always be available
      or free of errors. The information on the site is general. To the extent the law allows, we
      are not responsible for loss caused by relying on it. Nothing in this agreement limits
      responsibility that the law doesn't allow to be limited.
    </p>

    <h2>9. Privacy and cookies</h2>
    <p>
      How we handle information you send us is in our{' '}
      <a href={withBase('/privacy/')}>privacy notice</a>. The site sets no cookies: see our{' '}
      <a href={withBase('/cookies/')}>cookie policy</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>10. Changes and law</h2>
    <p>
      We may update this agreement, and the version on this page is the one that applies. It is
      governed by the law of England and Wales, and disputes go to the courts of England and Wales.
      Questions: <a href={`mailto:${site.contact.email}`}>{site.contact.email}</a>.
    </p>
  </LegalDoc>

  <TalkBanner />

  <SiteFooter slot="footer" />
</BaseLayout>
